#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1403 expect=skipped domain=DM
#note "RFCENDTC is not present at all (a study with no challenge agent need not carry the pair). Both variables are Expected in SENDIG-AR 1.0 DM and are listed in Requirements.Variables.All, so the rule is skipped rather than run -- and with no end date there is nothing to compare, so silence is correct either way."
#library standard=sendig-ar version=1-0
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SUBJID   type=Char label="Subject Identifier for the Study"
col RFCSTDTC type=Char label="Date/Time of First Challenge Agent Admin"
---
STUDY01 | DM | STUDY01-001 | 001 | 2020-01-05
STUDY01 | DM | STUDY01-002 | 002 | 2020-01-21
